{"version":1,"content":"<p>針對美國早前以「涉疆強迫勞動」為由，宣布禁止進口3間中國生物醫藥企業的產品。</p><p>中國商務部新聞發言人今（29日）回應稱，中國不存在強迫勞動，美方相關措施毫無事實依據，持續「操弄人權議題，行單邊保護主義和霸凌之實」，中方對此強烈譴責、堅決反對。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T07:41:33.044552+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:22:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:58:54.892173+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T07:38:12.616392+00:00","content_hash":"cac1b1be78768130e00cc3efd99deb769eb663937bab30ba745e267f718636ad","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}